## 🎯 Study Tips for ADHD/Dyslexia

✅ **Chunk it**: Study one section at a time (15-20 min max)  
✅ **Say it out loud**: Explain concepts to yourself or a rubber duck 🦆  
✅ **Draw it**: Sketch simple diagrams (even stick figures help!)  
✅ **Use color**: Highlight key terms in consistent colors  
✅ **Teach back**: After reading, try to explain it without looking  
✅ **Take breaks**: 5 min walk/stretch between sections  
✅ **Use audio**: Record yourself reading notes, listen while walking  

> 🌟 **Remember**: You don't need to memorize everything today. Recognition + understanding = passing. Depth comes with practice.

